    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:b439ea92-2568-46f3-9dd4-184340eb1ff9",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Bryan Beecher",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ab439ea92-2568-46f3-9dd4-184340eb1ff9",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Hi, Tom.  Thanks for posting this patch.  I'd like to be sure I understand how to use it properly.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "If I apply this patch, does it then mean that I can use a ResourceMatch stanza like yours above, say:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "<ResourceMatch MatchId=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:xacml:1.0:function:string-equal\">",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<AttributeValue DataType=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\">info:fedora/icpsr:FOO</AttributeValue>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ResourceAttributeDesignator AttributeId=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#hasModel\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "DataType=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\" MustBePresent=\"false\"/>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "</ResourceMatch> ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "to match an assertion I make in RELS-EXT like this:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "<fedora-model:hasModel rdf:resource=\"info:fedora/icpsr:FOO\"></fedora-model:hasModel>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Or have I misunderstood what this patch allows me to do?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As context I'm building a Fedora repository using the 3.1 release.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
