    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:b439ea92-2568-46f3-9dd4-184340eb1ff9",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Bryan Beecher",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ab439ea92-2568-46f3-9dd4-184340eb1ff9",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Hi, Tom.  Thanks for posting this patch.  I'd like to be sure I understand how to use it properly.</p>\n\n<p>If I apply this patch, does it then mean that I can use a ResourceMatch stanza like yours above, say:</p>\n\n<p>        &lt;ResourceMatch MatchId=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:xacml:1.0:function:string-equal\"&gt;<br/>\n          &lt;AttributeValue DataType=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\"&gt;info:fedora/icpsr:FOO&lt;/AttributeValue&gt;<br/>\n          &lt;ResourceAttributeDesignator AttributeId=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#hasModel\"<br/>\n            DataType=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\" MustBePresent=\"false\"/&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;/ResourceMatch&gt; </p>\n\n<p>to match an assertion I make in RELS-EXT like this:</p>\n\n<p>                    &lt;fedora-model:hasModel rdf:resource=\"info:fedora/icpsr:FOO\"&gt;&lt;/fedora-model:hasModel&gt;<br/>\n?</p>\n\n<p>Or have I misunderstood what this patch allows me to do?</p>\n\n<p>As context I'm building a Fedora repository using the 3.1 release.</p>",
     "created": "27/Jul/09 12:00 PM",
     "id": "10981",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10479/comment/10981",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:b439ea92-2568-46f3-9dd4-184340eb1ff9",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f01d50b1aa3dd56495355191824d2754?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-2.png"
