      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Thanks for the report and patch Thomas.  It has been applied to trunk with tests, and will be included in the 3.3 release.</p>\n\n<p>To confirm, this allows the use of the RELS-EXT-asserted content model(s) in XACML policies.</p>",
     "created": "23/Nov/09 5:12 AM",
